  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-video>",
      "lede": "Reproductor con chrome propio al estilo YouTube: barra de progreso con buffer y\r\n          scrubber, fila de controles con volumen desplegable, velocidad, picture-in-picture\r\n          y pantalla completa. Los controles se ocultan solos mientras reproduce.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-video\r\n            id=\"v1\"\r\n            controls\r\n            playsinline\r\n            src=\"https://interactive-examples.mdn.mozilla.net/media/cc0-videos/flower.mp4\"\r\n            style=\"max-width:36rem\"\r\n          ></is-video>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p class=\"lede\" id=\"log\">eventos: —</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "examples",
      "title": "Sin controles / muted",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-video\r\n            muted\r\n            loop\r\n            playsinline\r\n            controls=\"false\"\r\n            src=\"https://interactive-examples.mdn.mozilla.net/media/cc0-videos/flower.mp4\"\r\n            style=\"max-width:20rem\"\r\n          ></is-video>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<is-video\r\n  controls\r\n  playsinline\r\n  src=\"video.mp4\"\r\n></is-video>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shortcuts",
      "title": "Atajos de teclado",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>Con el foco en el reproductor (es <code>tabindex=\"0\"</code> por defecto):</p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "<tr><th>Tecla",
            "Acción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>espacio</code> <code>k</code>",
              "reproducir / pausar"
            ],
            [
              "<code>←</code> <code>→</code>",
              "± 5 segundos"
            ],
            [
              "<code>j</code> <code>l</code>",
              "± 10 segundos"
            ],
            [
              "<code>↑</code> <code>↓</code>",
              "± 5 % de volumen"
            ],
            [
              "<code>m</code>",
              "silenciar"
            ],
            [
              "<code>f</code>",
              "pantalla completa"
            ],
            [
              "<code>0</code> … <code>9</code>",
              "saltar al 0 %, 10 % … 90 %"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>Con el ratón: clic en la imagen alterna play, doble clic abre pantalla completa.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reference",
      "title": "Referencia",
